The '''Imperial Remnant safe house'''<ref name="Handbook">''[[Star Wars: The Mandalorian Handbook]]''</ref> was located on [[Nevarro]] where [[Gideon's Imperial remnant]] was stationed shortly after the fall of the [[Galactic Empire]], under the leadership of "[[The Client]]." Several [[stormtrooper]]s were stationed there, as was the [[scientist]] [[Doctor|Dr.]] [[Penn Pershing]]. A [[bounty hunter]] known as "[[Din Djarin|the Mandalorian]]" visited the facility in [[9 ABY]] to meet with the Client about a [[bounty]] on an asset, [[Din Grogu]], known as "the Child."<ref name="Chapter 1" /> The [[Mandalorian]] [[Mission to Arvala-7|retrieved]] the Child and turned it over to the Client, but later returned to the facility to [[Incident on Nevarro|rescue]] the Child.<ref name="Chapter 3">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 3: The Sin}}</ref>

